    "The aged fabric pad in the detail view lacks the fine dust layer seen on the metal surfaces, making it look slightly cleaner than the surrounding environment.",
    "The rust transition on the locker in the detail view is a bit sharp, which could be softened to look more like natural weathering."
  ],
